[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4761627627","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120507#issuecomment-4761627627","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120507","id":4761627627,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG9Cr6w","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-21T10:13:44Z","updated_at":"2026-06-21T10:13:44Z","body":"> Feels like what one would expect the slider to behave.\r\n\r\nThis is a potentially breaking change, and not that intuitive. E.g. consider a StyleBoxFlat with a border on either top or bottom:\r\n\r\n- v4.7.stable.official [5b4e0cb0f]:\r\n<img width=\"1307\" height=\"514\" alt=\"Godot_v4 7-stable_win64_YZCfIIhYRy\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/efe97579-c32b-47d7-82b4-f08ebd6389ea\" />\r\n\r\n- This PR:\r\n<img width=\"1309\" height=\"308\" alt=\"godot windows editor x86_64_W6CvI3g2Jg\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/78fae238-4867-439d-9fc4-228bf124c28e\" />","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4761627627/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4762012858","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120507#issuecomment-4762012858","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120507","id":4762012858,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG9aMug","user":{"login":"neclor","id":81529592,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNTI5NTky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81529592?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor","html_url":"https://github.com/neclor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-21T12:43:44Z","updated_at":"2026-06-21T12:55:21Z","body":"In that case, I think more substantial changes are needed here - it might be worth adding `flip_v` (and by analogy `flip_h`) flags to `StyleBox` to support drawing textures in a flipped orientation.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4762012858/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4762795569","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120507#issuecomment-4762795569","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120507","id":4762795569,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG-J-MQ","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-21T17:49:01Z","updated_at":"2026-06-21T17:49:01Z","body":"Good idea. This way we could also maintain the current behavior, so it wouldn't break if there's people relying on how it currently works.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4762795569/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4763708045","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120507#issuecomment-4763708045","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120507","id":4763708045,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG_BqjQ","user":{"login":"neclor","id":81529592,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNTI5NTky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81529592?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor","html_url":"https://github.com/neclor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-22T00:04:17Z","updated_at":"2026-06-22T02:08:01Z","body":"I added `flip_h`/`flip_v` to `StyleBoxTexture` since the vertical slider fix required the fill texture to render in the opposite direction depending on orientation. \r\nAnd this no longer breaks the previous behavior for `StyleBoxFlat`\r\n\r\nTo make this work I had to extend `CommandNinePatch` with a flags field to carry flip information through the rendering pipeline, and fix a subtle bug in the canvas shader: when passing a negative src_rect size to signal a flip for nine-patch rendering.\r\n\r\nSince this touches the canvas shader, the rendering pipeline, and extends `StyleBoxTexture` beyond the original slider fix, I'm not sure whether it makes more sense to split this into a separate PR.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4763708045/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4763822429","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120507#issuecomment-4763822429","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120507","id":4763822429,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG_IpXQ","user":{"login":"neclor","id":81529592,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNTI5NTky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81529592?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor","html_url":"https://github.com/neclor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-22T00:38:44Z","updated_at":"2026-06-22T00:42:25Z","body":"By the way, I also noticed same problem with the horizontal slider when enabled RTL","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4763822429/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4764076670","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120507#issuecomment-4764076670","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120507","id":4764076670,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG_YKfg","user":{"login":"neclor","id":81529592,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNTI5NTky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81529592?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor","html_url":"https://github.com/neclor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-22T01:59:44Z","updated_at":"2026-06-22T02:14:43Z","body":"I added a new flag that allows selecting the desired slider behavior for anchoring the grabber area texture.\r\nThis also fixes an inconsistency with RTL layout: previously, the grabber area texture behavior differed between LTR and RTL modes.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"836\" height=\"357\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ff0be70c-114f-430d-b7f0-e4c522c5de93\" />\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n<img width=\"600\" height=\"300\" alt=\"before\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/15b1f4a1-0d95-492f-a923-4a7aadd8c5e2\" />\r\nRTL\r\n<img width=\"600\" height=\"300\" alt=\"before_rtl\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cae6f39a-a267-4618-a035-131abaf7c3f5\" />\r\nThis PR:\r\n<img width=\"600\" height=\"300\" alt=\"after\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1bf19116-9e85-4ca7-8c8a-ff03814fb15f\" />\r\nRTL\r\n<img width=\"600\" height=\"300\" alt=\"after_rtl\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/52463c14-de3b-4766-b69b-471ef8e53844\" />\r\n\r\nPlease let me know what you think about this.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4764076670/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4771045597","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120507#issuecomment-4771045597","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120507","id":4771045597,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHGBg3Q","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-22T17:29:05Z","updated_at":"2026-06-22T17:29:05Z","body":"The change in the slider files look fine, so my approval stands. The ones in the render files will need to be reviewed by someone in the area.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4771045597/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4773979964","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120507#issuecomment-4773979964","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120507","id":4773979964,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHI0nPA","user":{"login":"neclor","id":81529592,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNTI5NTky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81529592?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor","html_url":"https://github.com/neclor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-22T23:10:29Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T06:42:11Z","body":"NinePatch is working correctly - at least, I haven't noticed any problems.\r\nThe CPU side already handles the flip via rect calculations in `canvas_item_add_nine_patch`- identical to `canvas_item_add_texture_rect_region`. The shader change is only needed to fix a double-flip: without it, negative `src_rect.zw` triggers the vertex swap via `lessThan` and flips UV at line 600, cancelling each other out.\r\nI'd update the approach if you can suggest an alternative.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4773979964/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4838518007","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120507#issuecomment-4838518007","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120507","id":4838518007,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIGXs9w","user":{"login":"neclor","id":81529592,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNTI5NTky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81529592?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor","html_url":"https://github.com/neclor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-29T23:40:53Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T06:32:55Z","body":"I decided to split this PR into smaller ones to make it easier to review:\r\n\r\n- #120753\r\n- #120754\r\n- #120755","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4838518007/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]